# Dev docs sync

When changing public API, DTOs, or integration contracts:

1. Update OpenAPI/AsyncAPI or contract file in `engineering/contracts/`.
2. Update related ADR if architecture decision changed.
3. Reference spec section in PR description when behavior ties to `references.primary_spec`.

Do not merge API behavior changes without corresponding contract update unless user explicitly accepts drift (document in ADR).
